nstitution level, which is where an operating balance actually sits. Held on class: numradar (a WhatsApp registration check, 401 behind a bearer key, four tools unpublished, paid-only from 9 dollars a month, the verification commodity already answered by the phone intelligence entry and the email verification trio, with an explicit promotion test recorded), mkts Market Data (15 read-only tools with provenance, in a stock and market data slice already carried by Altair, ValuEdge, fAlpha and BDE plus nine EDGAR surfaces), Signbee (second e-signature surface beside zsign #6415), doc2json (document extraction class), Avo Cado Read (reader class), GotSOL.app, Shellway Relay and web2mcp (agent payments and developer infrastructure), DiscoverLaunches, GitHubCard, The Charter Desk, Pokerai API, SlotVFX and AwesomeVideo. TradingCalc #6502 was an update request, not an arrival, and it reports that the mcp.so submission edit form does not save, the same fault as #5788, recorded as a platform defect. The five tracked listing surfaces were re-probed in the same pass: CorpusIQ is live on mcpservers.org at /servers/corpusiq-io, on Smithery as Cprusiq with unlisted false, and on Glama both as CorpusIQ/corpusiq-docs and as the connector io.corpusiq/multi-source-mcp on the newer /mcp/connectors/ route, the official registry carries io.corpusiq/multi-source-mcp as active with the mcp2.corpusiq.io remote, and mcp.so remains not listed with all four direct slugs at 404, the free route sign-in gated and the paid route declined. A fresh two-pass GitHub directory search ran 20 queries and returned 282 directory-style candidates with issues enabled, none of them a business-operations MCP directory that accepts an external submission. Counts: mcpservers.org /all proxy read 12 unique slugs, mcp.so recentServers 30 parsed cards, issue window #6499 to #6510, guide tree 1,069 server entries before this pass and 1,070 after, across 1,454 files.